  {
    "id": "bme280_tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "BME280 Weather Station & AI Predictor",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Receives real-time BME280 environmental data from STM32 + ESP8266 over MQTT (broker.emqx.io:1883, topic: college/weather/bme280), dynamically synthesizes regional microclimates and barometric altitude, queries OpenWeatherMap REST API for ground-truth comparison, and renders a live interactive dashboard."
